oal, watercolour, classic oil, impasto inspired by Van Gogh, pointillism inspired by Seurat, impressionism inspired by Monet, Renaissance inspired by Da Vinci, and Rembrandt. Each one changes how your strokes look on the canvas.\n", "short_description": "Paint in a marble temple floating above the clouds. Pick up real-feeling brushes, load them with colour, mix on your palette and paint stroke by stroke. Take art classes, get your painting graded from 0 to 10 and unlock the styles of the great masters, from watercolour and charcoal to impasto and pointillism. Or switch to Free Paint: choose your canvas, save your work to finish another day, export it as an image and keep every piece in your personal library.\n"}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/66569cd9-f94f-4752-84b1-109dea15ddbb", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Francisco Manuel Mier y Teran Almazan", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://claude.ai/code/artifact/66569cd9-f94f-4752-84b1-109dea15ddbb", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1819021644882647"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE", "SITTING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1122168723582563"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1424296772934420"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1424296772934420"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1789484520, "status": "PUBLISHED"